# Pairs with RuleAuthoringConfined: the tenant policy facade writes a tenant rule without checking it is confined to its tenant.

MODULE: FacadeSkipsConfinement
TARGET: RuleAuthoringConfined
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the tenant policy facade writes a tenant rule without checking it is confined to its tenant
PERTURBS: TenantFacadeUpsert

--- FIND
    /\ r.owner = T
    /\ Conforms(r)

--- REPLACE
    /\ r.owner = T

--- END
